{
"sid": 88,
"uid": "D_035",
"content": {
"sentence": {
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"sentences": [
{
"id": 5,
"sentences": [
{
"id": 6,
"choice": true,
"text": {
"en": "Pourquoi ça?"
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"sentences": [
{
"id": 10,
"sentences": [
{
"id": 19,
"text": {
"en": "Plutôt respectable.."
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"speaker": "O_035"
}
],
"text": {
"en": "Arriver ici n'est pas chose aisée.. Tu as réussi à déverrouiller l'entrée de la zone de Confinement."
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"speaker": "O_035"
}
]
},
{
"id": 7,
"choice": true,
"sentences": [
{
"id": 20,
"sentences": [
{
"id": 21,
"choice": true,
"sentences": [
{
"id": 23,
"sentences": [
{
"id": 25,
"text": {
"en": "Pourtant un simple masque ne devrait présenter aucun danger non?"
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"speaker": "O_035"
}
],
"text": {
"en": "On me dit que je suis trop dangereux."
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"speaker": "O_035"
}
],
"text": {
"en": "Pourquoi es-tu enfermé?"
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
}
},
{
"id": 22,
"choice": true,
"sentences": [
{
"id": 24,
"text": {
"en": "Ehh oui... à quoi bon enfermer un masque aussi ordinaire? Quel dommage."
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"speaker": "O_035"
}
],
"text": {
"en": "Un masque ordinaire..."
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
}
}
],
"text": {
"en": "Juste un masque ordinaire"
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"speaker": "O_035"
}
],
"text": {
"en": "Qui es-tu?"
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
}
},
{
"id": 8,
"choice": true,
"sentences": [
{
"id": 11,
"sentences": [
{
"id": 12,
"sentences": [
{
"id": 13,
"choice": true,
"sentences": [
{
"id": 16,
"sentences": [
{
"id": 18,
"text": {
"en": "Un liquide noir... Rapporte-le moi et je t'aiderai."
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"speaker": "O_035"
}
],
"text": {
"en": "J'ai besoin que tu me rapportes un objet. Il se trouve dans la salle de stockage."
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"speaker": "O_035"
}
],
"text": {
"en": "Quoi donc?"
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
}
},
{
"id": 14,
"choice": true,
"sentences": [
{
"id": 15,
"text": {
"en": "Mais bien sûr, de toute façon tu n'as pas d'autre choix..."
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"speaker": "O_035"
}
],
"text": {
"en": "Je peux vraiment te faire confiance?"
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
}
}
],
"text": {
"en": "Je pourrais, mais tu dois tout d'abord faire quelque chose pour moi."
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"speaker": "O_035"
}
],
"text": {
"en": "Hmmm... Voilà une demande intéressante."
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"speaker": "O_035"
}
],
"text": {
"en": "Aide-moi à sortir d'ici"
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
}
}
],
"text": {
"en": "Oh, un prisonnier… Je suis surpris que tu aies réussi à arriver jusqu’ici."
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"speaker": "O_035"
},
{
"id": 26,
"sentences": [
{
"id": 27,
"sentences": [
{
"id": 28,
"sentences": [
{
"id": 29,
"text": {
"en": "Pour l'autre? Tu te débrouilles... Un plaisir de collaborer avec toi."
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"speaker": "O_035"
}
],
"text": {
"en": "Comme je suis de bonne humeur, je vais te donner le code du coffre de la salle de stockage qui devrait te donner l'une des clés."
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"speaker": "O_035"
}
],
"text": {
"en": "Le seul moyen pour toi de sortir du site serait de récupérer les deux clés d'urgence et de les insérer dans la porte de sortie."
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"speaker": "O_035"
}
],
"text": {
"en": "Parfait... En échange, je vais te donner quelques informations."
},
"voice": {
"en": [
{},
{},
{},
{}
]
},
"speaker": "O_035"
}
]
},
"nextID": 30
}
